abstract: "Read the three.ws vanity-address grind-bounty market and proof-of-grind rarity gallery from any AI agent. Quote a pattern's difficulty + USDC price, appraise any address's rarity, and browse the bounty board, claimable queue, stats, leaderboard, config, and gallery. Read-only — no key, no signer, no payment."
